### TASK ###
Decide whether the following sentence from one of Charles Dickens's letters contains a reference to any of his works. If YES, assign all applicable reference categories; if NO, output ["J"].

### OUTPUT FORMAT ###
Respond only in valid JSON with the following field:
{
"categories": [list of one or more of the following: A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I] or ["J"]
}
Do not include explanations, Markdown, or any text outside the JSON object.

### AVAILABLE CATEGORIES ###
* A - Inspirations and Influences
* B - Writing Process and Creative Insight
* C - Elements of Fictional Craft
* D - Editorial and Publishing Processes
* E - Quality and Evaluation
* F - Financial and Legal Aspects
* G - Gratitude and Acknowledgement
* H - Marketing and Promotion
* I - Impact and Reception
* J - No reference to Dickens's works present

### EXAMPLES OF VALID OUTPUTS ###
{
"categories": ["D", "B"]
}
{
"categories": ["C", "I"]
}
{
"categories": ["J"]
}

### INPUT ###
METADATA:
Recipient: {RECIPIENT}
Date: {DATE}
SENTENCE:
{SENTENCE}

### OUTPUT ###

